/S /P
/P 133 0 R
/E (Training deep neural networks with suitable learning-rate schedules and hyperparameter configurations is challenging and often requires repeated manual experimentation. Different configurations can produce different results in terms of accuracy, loss and training time. Therefore, an automated framework is needed to test, compare and identify effective training configurations, reducing manual effort and improving the training process.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
